   "media_type": "VIDEO",
   "media_product_type": "REELS",
   "caption": "These are the Keyboard shortcuts I use so I never have to touch my mouse.\n\n- “Alt + Tab”: Quickly cycle between the windows you have open in the background without having to click into them\n\n- “Windows Key + Arrows”: Move windows from one monitor to another or split a window on your screen, add in the Shift key  to snap windows between monitors\n\n- “Windows + L”: Allows you to instantly lock your computer without having to do anything else\n\n- “Ctrl + Y”: You probably know about Ctrl + Z to undo something, but this re-does what you just undid\n\n- “Ctrl + T”: Opens a new tab in your browser, and you can press F5 or Ctrl + R to refresh the page\n\nFollow for more tips like this, I would appreciate it!",
